  "description_short": "Paint your own ceramics while enjoying family-friendly meals in a creative, relaxed George setting.",
  "description_long": "Clay Cafe George offers a unique dining experience where creativity meets comfort food. This family-friendly spot combines a full restaurant menu with a ceramic painting studio, making it ideal for birthday parties, rainy days, or simply a meal with a twist. Kids can design their own masterpieces while parents enjoy coffee and conversation.\n\nThe menu features crowd-pleasers like burgers, pizzas, and wraps alongside breakfast options and daily specials. The atmosphere is relaxed and colourful, with painted ceramics lining the walls as testament to countless family memories made here. Whether you're popping in for a quick bite or settling in for an afternoon of creativity, the staff make everyone feel welcome.\n\nLocated in George, it's become a go-to for locals and visitors looking for something beyond the standard restaurant experience. The combination of good food and hands-on activity means children stay happily occupied while adults can actually finish a meal in peace.",
